@startuml
!theme plain
title 企业知识问答时序图

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam defaultFontSize 13
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #47627A
skinparam ParticipantBorderColor #476D88
skinparam ParticipantBackgroundColor #F5F9FC
skinparam LifeLineBorderColor #7B94A8
skinparam LifeLineBackgroundColor white

actor "普通员工" as Employee
participant "浏览器前端" as Web
participant "FastAPI 问答接口" as API
participant "权限与安全模块" as Security
participant "TF-IDF 检索模块" as Search
database "SQLite 知识库" as DB
participant "回答生成模块" as Answer
participant "质量筛查任务" as Quality

Employee -> Web : 输入问题并提交
Web -> API : POST /api/ask
API -> Security : 校验会话、问答权限和敏感内容
Security --> API : 用户身份与可访问密级
API -> Search : compute_answer(question, top_k)
Search -> DB : 读取权限范围内的文档片段
DB --> Search : 片段文本与词频数据
Search -> Search : 构建查询向量\n计算余弦相似度并排序
Search --> API : Top-K 命中片段
API -> Answer : 生成基于证据的回答与置信度
Answer --> API : 回答、引用、置信度
API -> DB : 保存问答日志
API -->> Quality : 后台创建质量筛查任务
API --> Web : 返回回答、引用与日志编号
Web --> Employee : 展示回答结果

Quality -> DB : 读取问答日志和引用分数
Quality -> Quality : 计算综合质量分与风险原因
Quality -> DB : 保存质量筛查结果
@enduml
